Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:20.93,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:24.85,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,You're my...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:43.20,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,So you use the same power we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:50.14,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!\N If you're going to interfere, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:57.16,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,All we can do as Ring Princesses \Nis watch over their battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:01:00.34,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,That's our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.01,0:01:11.38,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,I commend you for opposing me \Nso well with your strength alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:16.34,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Though you'll soon run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:20.65,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,When people are plunged into a crisis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.09,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,they reveal their true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:21.80,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,So this is the fate of the cat people, \Nrenowned for our martial prowess?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.70,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,We've grown weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.15,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,But you show potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:30.12,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,Our ancient sword arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:32.79,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,Do you wish to learn their secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:41.09,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,Your eyes tell me \Nyou haven't lost your composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:45.17,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,So long as you retain that look, \Nyou'll surely grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.59,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,Join forces with the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:51.26,Default,FirePrincess,0,0,0,,Claim unbridled power for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:56.44,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I don't need that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:59.93,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,My strength doesn't belong to me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.34,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,It exists for the sake of others!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:06.11,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,That's what I've learned!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:18.64,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,Nefritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:21.85,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,There's no need for us to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.88,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,I know you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:31.28,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,What you seek is wisdom... and knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:34.31,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,So don't you crave knowledge \Nimpossible to find in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.40,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,Knowledge from the Abyss?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:42.23,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,The Abyss envelops this entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:45.84,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,The Abyss knows everything about this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:49.74,Default,WindPrincess,0,0,0,,It could grant you all \Nthe knowledge that you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:54.52,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,On my journey alongside Satou-sama, \NI learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:59.21,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I learned there's something you can't \Nobtain just from reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.30,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,That's experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:06.15,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I want to see things with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:08.43,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I want to touch them and find out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:12.10,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm done with just being protected \Nand granted everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:23.59,Default,WaterPrincess,0,0,0,,Think about it for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:27.26,Default,WaterPrincess,0,0,0,,Even if it's thinned, you still \Nhave dragon blood within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:32.91,Default,WaterPrincess,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to shed noble dragon \Nblood for the sake of these lesser beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.30,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,It doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:38.69,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,They can't do anything without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.00,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,It's the duty of nobles to look \Nafter and care for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:48.47,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Besides, they're quite good people, \Ndespite how they may seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:02.48,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,I can't afford to look bad, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:15.58,Default,EarthPrincess,0,0,0,,Child created by the dwarves,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:20.87,Default,EarthPrincess,0,0,0,,if you truly care for us, \Nthen surrender to the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:26.57,Default,EarthPrincess,0,0,0,,It would be easy to revive the dwarves \Nwith the power of the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:30.34,Default,EarthPrincess,0,0,0,,I've been revived by \Nthe Abyss King too, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:31.89,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.47,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,You're not a dwarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:37.88,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,You've already too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:42.18,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,The dwarves are precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:48.40,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,But I'll decide what's most important!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:03.25,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,It's not my strength alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:08.78,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:12.74,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,This strength is welling up within me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:16.35,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I can sense everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:19.06,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,So you still won't break?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:24.44,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Then we'll simply continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.26,0:07:27.85,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:34.61,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Could it be that all of these—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:38.30,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.59,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,He created rings?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:44.41,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,If he's capable of that, then that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.87,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,No, this isn't the time to worry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:50.63,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,I need to find an opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.80,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,Just one strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:57.22,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,As long as I can get in close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:13.69,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:22.24,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Marse-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:24.21,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Go, Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.54,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Don't waste this chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:27.82,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:08:59.64,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.37,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Did you get him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.51,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:24.06,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Is that a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.93,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,That's the man I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:29.19,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,The man known as the Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:33.94,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,The Abyss King should have been \Ndefeated with the power of the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:36.24,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,but this time he's using rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.61,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,You must have sensed it vaguely as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:42.81,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Well, I had been curious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.19,0:09:44.83,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:50.16,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I didn't like the idea of the man who fought \Nto protect the world ending up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:53.65,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,After being sealed away \Nalongside the Abyss King,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.92,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,I was incorporated into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.18,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,What a pitiful fate for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.48,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,New Ring King,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:09.31,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,you possess power equal to mine \Nwhen I was the Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:12.60,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Perhaps even greater power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:15.96,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Just like I once did,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:21.99,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,you possess enough power to strike down \Nthe Abyss if that were all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:30.00,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Yet the source of that power—\Nyour bonds with others—will waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.50,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,And what lies within your own heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:36.18,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Satou-kun, don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:38.17,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,...will waver as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.19,0:10:41.98,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:46.68,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Everyone possesses a void in their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:51.11,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,You managed to avoid \Nbeing consumed by the Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.11,0:10:54.44,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,but you couldn't completely eliminate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:00.80,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:04.74,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Plunge into the Abyss within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.20,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:09.22,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.80,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,He's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:14.64,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,To a place you can never reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:20.28,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,All we Ring Princesses can do is watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:23.74,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We're powerless. Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:28.23,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Why aren't you disappearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.20,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,The shadows of the other \NPrincesses all vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.30,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Are you different somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:36.44,Flashback,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.90,Flashback,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I'll stay with you at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:42.00,Flashback,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:47.68,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,He really was a pitiful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:52.73,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,No matter how much he sought love,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:56.28,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,all that awaited him was loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.39,0:12:01.77,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:06.01,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,There's a bottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:08.64,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So it's... not outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:12.42,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Then what is that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:15.77,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I can see something inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.50,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.21,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,The Abyss King's castle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.54,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,This is the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:33.16,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,It's where the world began, \Nand where it is all meant to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:40.37,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,All light is but a fleeting bubble, \Njust like the world of Arnulus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:46.80,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,The world you came from is but\N one of the countless droplets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:52.04,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Arnulus was born in this Abyss by happenstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:56.14,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Eventually the bubble must burst
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:13:00.02,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,and return to the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:04.47,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,The power of Light resists that natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:06.61,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,It's a distortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:11.60,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Hey, Marse! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.94,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Where's Satou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:17.15,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Satou-kun was swallowed into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:20.63,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,He's in that sphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:24.33,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,And the Abyss King?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:28.66,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The Abyss King vanished, \Nlike he was following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:32.33,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,I'll destroy it and save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:34.26,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Wait! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.99,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,My Ring King is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:37.83,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,What I feared is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:40.31,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Amber is panicking for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.72,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.22,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The former Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:53.10,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,He defeated the Abyss King\N and was sealed away along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.59,0:13:57.94,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You heard about him from Peridot-dono, \Nthe Elder of the Elves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:02.84,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Are you saying that Satou's been \Ntrapped in the Abyss as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.23,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,By the Abyss King this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:11.95,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Is this the end of the legend I believed in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.95,0:14:13.16,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Alabaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:17.50,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I want you all to listen to me calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:22.97,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,We might be able to seal \Nthe Abyss King away right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:28.88,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,This play is most likely \Na gamble for the Abyss King too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:30.02,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,If we let this chance slip—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.50,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Hold on, Alabaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.65,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,If we were to do that, then Satou would...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:39.44,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:41.97,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,If we seal him away now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:46.89,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,then Satou-kun will meet the same fate \Nas the former Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:56.62,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:57.87,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.25,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,He was suddenly defeated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:09.51,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:11.21,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:18.57,Default,Shadow1,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.41,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:23.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I made a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:24.95,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I chose Hime!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:31.66,Default,Shadow2,0,0,0,,You wouldn't choose because choosing one \Nof us meant not choosing the others, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:39.92,Default,Shadow3,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't you choose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:42.13,Default,Shadow4,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:47.05,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,You're the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:51.39,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Resented for your choices, \Nfeared for your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:54.68,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,and all that awaits you is \Nbetrayal and a lonely death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:03.07,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,This darkness is your Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:05.95,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,The shadow you cast by choosing light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:09.28,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,That is what you fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:14.10,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Because you know that both trying to claim \Neverything and choosing just one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:17.86,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,will cause darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:21.50,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,No matter which answer you arrive at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:25.85,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Why did the world give birth to the Ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:30.97,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Why is the bearer of the Ring forced \Nto make a choice with no right answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:34.87,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Why must the bearer of the Ring suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:39.55,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,This world is merely \Na bubble born by happenstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:42.82,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than a twisted illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.47,0:16:48.15,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,That's why it forces \Na twisted question upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:52.14,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,The world struggles to resist the Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:55.27,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,yet it longs to return to \Nthe Abyss from which it came.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:59.54,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Now, there are no questions nor choices here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:05.01,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Return to drifting eternally within \Nthe Abyss, mother of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:10.43,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The former Ring King was sealed \Naway alongside the Abyss King,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:12.91,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,and they merged together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:18.43,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Right now, Satou-kun is facing \Nthe former Ring King, who is clad in the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:21.60,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,This isn't the same as it was in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:24.11,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The power of the Ring won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.32,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Did you know this, Alabaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:30.51,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,No one knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:33.84,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Though we have to fight anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:36.94,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,That's why... I told Satou-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.15,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,To make sure he was ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:45.04,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,If this continues, and he doesn't return...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.39,0:17:48.51,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:50.84,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,What is it, Granart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:00.14,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:03.52,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Storm the Abyss King's forces \Nin one fell swoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:07.99,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Support the Ring King while he's \Nshaving away the Abyss King's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:09.49,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:11.07,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,The Imperial Army?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:12.16,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Romca too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.94,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Needakitta and Maasa as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.70,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Everyone's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.48,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.80,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,How can we give up here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:22.69,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,We made it this far by believing in Satou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:26.32,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,If the power of our bonds \Nis the power of the Ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.53,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,then we have to stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.43,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Let's go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.43,0:18:31.51,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:34.43,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Waiting around here won't help anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.51,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Satou is fighting the Abyss King right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:40.10,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,So we need to fight too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:41.84,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:45.10,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Nothing will happen \Nif we just keep waiting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:47.32,Default,Sphir,0,0,0,,Nefritis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:50.27,Default,Sphir,0,0,0,,Honestly, they're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:53.39,Default,Sphir,0,0,0,,I hate acting on impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:19:00.58,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Right. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:03.43,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I was misled by the legends,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:07.79,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,and nearly lost my faith in Satou-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:10.51,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,So this is Satou-kun's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.64,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The power that Satou-kun brought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:15.72,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Let's go, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:25.77,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:34.78,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,You've grown strong, Granart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.07,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Thanks to you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.16,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Father! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:44.46,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,Nef, Nef, Nef, Nefritis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:47.79,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,Where's Nefritis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:52.88,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,I won't forgive anyone \Nwho dares try to hurt Nefritis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.77,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Um, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:57.39,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:19:58.74,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,Damn Jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:01.01,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,He sure has a lot of pent up stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:03.35,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,Once this battle is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.35,0:20:06.86,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,he'll finally be able to return \Nto our homeland and calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:09.27,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,So hurry up and give your brother \Nsome peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:10.32,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:20.99,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,So this is the power of \Nthe Dragon Princess and the Dwarf Princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.50,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,What strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:28.21,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,Saphir-sama has grown so magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:45.06,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:49.28,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,They were wiped out \Nwhile possessing power like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:53.57,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The power of the Ring is \Nthe foundation of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.57,0:20:56.97,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,It runs through everything, \Nstrongly entwined with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:21:01.12,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone's feelings \Nare connected to Satou-kun as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.45,0:21:03.45,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Grandpa, let's do our part too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:04.38,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.33,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Satou.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.18,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Satou-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:10.29,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Satou.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.67,0:21:12.00,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,Ring King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:13.53,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.12,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,How pitiful, new Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:27.05,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm vanishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:30.39,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.71,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:36.43,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:48.61,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,He's been swallowed up by the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:51.05,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:57.88,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,The voices of us Ring Princesses were \Nunable to reach that man on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:02.30,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We were always stuck \Njust watching him from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.88,0:22:05.95,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Our destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:08.76,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:16.94,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,TRANSLATOR: JOHN PICKETT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:20.95,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,TIMER: KRZYSZTOF KUNC\NEDITOR: ZACHARY CARLYSLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.45,0:22:24.86,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,QC: WILLIAM HAGGARD\NFQC: SRIRAM GURUNATHAN

